ld. You control those objects, buff them and turn them into powerful sources of damage or blocks, to defeat the enemies.<br></li><li> <i>On-screen calculator:</i> The first game to give you more focus on planning your strategy by taking care of the chore of counting and calculating numbers for you. Just drag a rectangle on the screen to select things you want to calculate, and the game will show you how many HP, Attacks, Blocks, RAM Cost,... they have in total.<br></li><li> <i>Cyberpunk theme:</i> In this game, you're an entity living in the digital space, you go through <strong>nodes</strong> to reach the center of the Net and defeat it. All cards and items in the game are computer programming-related.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182490/extras/d917cfb61de639b371caa2412eb4f89e.poster.avif?t=1688187577\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182490/extras/d917cfb61de639b371caa2412eb4f89e.webm?t=1688187577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182490/extras/d917cfb61de639b371caa2412eb4f89e.mp4?t=1688187577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["Mini Fun Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182490/header.jpg?t=1688187577","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2023 Mini Fun Games","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2182490/527829/809aa0d5e040d27b532cd2bf83a4387d0574bef9/1751086563/dash_av1.mpd?t=1673168926","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2182490/527829/809aa0d5e040d27b532cd2bf83a4387d057